  <compounddef id="_h_s_m_x_x_f3_8h" kind="file" language="C++">
    <compoundname>HSMXXF3.h</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface to for all HSM-related operations. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><hruler/>
</para><para>This module provides functions for use of the Hardware Security Module.</para><para>The HSM initialization procedure must first enable the clock, then initialize the mailbox, and finally boot the device.</para><para>APIs are provided to synchronize access to the HSM and submit command tokens, constructed by TI crypto drivers.</para><para>Additional APIs to construct command tokens, interpret result token data as well as additional key/asset management operations. </para>    </detaileddescription>
